  "description": "This is one of the first models we came out with when we started Soulcraft. It’s our geared 26” bike. Remember 26” wheels? Funny how they worked so well for so many years and now people talk about them like disco music. Actually, that’s a perfect analogy because like disco, people love the way 26” bikes ride but it’s just not cool to admit you dig them. Mark our words; 26” will make a comeback. Get your disco ball ready.\n\n- 2 Coat Powder Paint With Iron Phosphate Pre-Treatment\n- Complete Custom Fitting\n- Externally Butted Head Tube\n- Frame Delivered Fully Prepped And Ready To Assemble With Rust Inhibitor Sprayed Inside Seat Tube And On All Bare Metal Surfaces\n- Gusseted Head Tube/Downtube Junction (where applicable)\n- Internally Butted Head Tube\n- Reinforced Seat Collar Insert\n- Rider Specific Tubeset\n- Sealed Tubeset (no vent holes)\n- Sloping Top Tube Standard\n- Stainless Steel Cable Stops And Brake Line Guides\n- Stamped head badge\n- Tig Welded Frame",
